1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,929
Bravi needs your help!

2
00:00:01,919 --> 00:00:06,275
Four magical doors are locked... and only your toothbrush can open them!

3
00:00:06,265 --> 00:00:08,111
Let's start up here, on this side.

4
00:00:08,101 --> 00:00:11,293
Brush the outside, the inside, and the tops of your teeth.

5
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,923
You did it! The first door is open!

6
00:00:32,913 --> 00:00:34,337
Look, a golden key!

7
00:00:34,327 --> 00:00:37,755
Follow it to the next tower. Top teeth, on the other side!

8
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:02,351
We found the Courage Shield!

9
00:01:02,341 --> 00:01:04,084
But its magic is sleeping...

10
00:01:04,214 --> 00:01:06,000
Let's bring back its sparkle!

11
00:01:05,990 --> 00:01:08,011
Bottom teeth now, right below.

12
00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:32,288
Just one door left!

13
00:01:32,278 --> 00:01:33,636
You're doing amazing!

14
00:01:33,626 --> 00:01:37,395
Let's finish our mission together. Bottom teeth, on the other side!
